# Every scratch index directory this project has built during ad-hoc
# experimentation (query.py, pool-coverage, cross-collection, fusion probes)
# is dot-prefixed and disposable -- regenerated from the corpus on demand.
# One (22MB) accidentally reached a commit via a broad `git add -A` once (see
# notes/findings.md F43); this blanket rule is the fix, not a case-by-case list.
.*_index*/
.query_offsets-*.json
# Cython-generated sources. Regenerated from the .pyx at build time, so
# committing them risks a stale copy being compiled instead of the real source.
submission/_fast.c
submission/_fastbuild.cpp
data/ext-*/
